OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start this morning,
OL,6,Fbut temperatures will soon rise to
OL,7,Ffeel pleasantly mild in sunny spells.
OL,8,FRemaining dry throughout and winds
OL,9,Fwill remain as a light or gentle
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be cool,
OL,13,Fbut temperatures will rise through the
OL,14,Fnight to feel mild by dawn. Spells of
OL,15,Frain will arrive from around the
OL,16,Fmiddle of the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
