OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FOvercast and murky with patchy
OL,6,Frain and some heavy outbreaks. Winds
OL,7,Fslowly strengthening, with some strong
OL,8,Fgusts in the evening, but feeling very
OL,9,Fmild with temperatures reaching the
OL,10,Fhigh-teens.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FStrong
OL,13,Fwinds during Tuesday but after passing
OL,14,Fshowers it will become brighter and
OL,15,Fcooler. Breezy during Wednesday with
OL,16,Fsunny spells, then increasingly
OL,17,Fcloudy, showery and windy through
OL,18,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
